      "id": 14,
      "key": "theme-gerow-seo_description",
      "value": "DISCC was founded in Varanasi in 1991 by Dr Tulsi.\nDISCC has a statute of humanitarian Non Governmental Organization (NGO), accepted and registered with the Indian government in 1991, which gave it an FCRA (« Fair Credit Reporting Act ») Number, which allows it to receive funds from abroad in order to support its actions. Every year a financial audit gives it a number of accreditation.",
